      "side": 1,
      "message": "yes, good point. As we are in constructor, we could either abort or support update wrapper code to support a null connector. Then, starts shall return an error, hence loadConfig will fail and we will fallback on hardcoded config of audio policy.\n\nSome slight changes would be required in EngineBase to expose an API to load the default config.\n\nHaving this fallback would align default and configurable engine.\n\nI can raise a bug and deliver whatever decision. Let me know!",
